            <title>[LU-18078] trigger global quota entry reintegration automatically</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-18078</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Track the activity of the global quota entry update, if the connection to the QMT is broken&lt;br/&gt;
for some reason, such as network error, trigger the global quota integration automatically&lt;br/&gt;
inside of Lustre instead of letting the user to trigger it manually.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
